      "issue": "The claim asserts 'No engineering disposition or temporary instruction was attached' as a condition implying an unapproved change occurred (or no documentation existed). Evidence finding-5cvaiz and finding-1yf38nl confirm the attachment field is blank. However, evidence IA-I01 explicitly states records do not establish whether a service-routing change had occurred; absence of a record does not prove its occurrence or non-occurrence.",
