      "issue": "The claim asserts 'No evidence of documented confirmation' between Utilities and RHOB regarding the air-low alarm. Evidence finding-h3ez7i notes that while communication occurred (RHOB requested attendance at 10:02), there is no record confirming agreement on cause or corrective action before pausing work.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "Evidence showing whether a documented confirmation existed, OR evidence establishing the absence of such documentation beyond what is already known from finding-h3ez7i.","question":"Is there any other source that records an explicit acknowledgment between Utilities and RHOB about the air-low alarm cause or corrective action before work pause?"
